# Website screenshots (canonical — Sep 2026)

When updating homepage / marketing-site screenshots for new app features, **match this live format**. Do not invent a new framing style.

Live site: https://hoon-chang.github.io/barem-site/

## Canonical asset

| Item | Rule |
|------|------|
| Path | `public/screenshots/01_home.png` … `07_profile.png` (deployed: `docs/screenshots/`) |
| Size | **414 × 900** PNG (RGBA) |
| Content | App UI only — status bar + UI. Cream background `#F7F6F3` |
| Island in PNG | **None.** Sim/real captures have no hardware Dynamic Island |
| Not in PNG | Device bezel, island paste/erase, store headlines, disclaimers, marketing canvas |

## How the phone look is made

`PhoneShot` (`src/components/phone-shot.tsx`) composites each shot into:

- **Frame:** `public/brand/iphone-16-pro-frame-v2.png` (iPhone 16 Pro Black Titanium)
- **Screen rect:** `iphone-16-pro-template.json` → `x=102 y=100 w=1206 h=2622` in `1406×2822`
- **Island:** **frame only** — never paste or erase an island on the screenshot

Bump the frame filename (`-v2`, `-v3`, …) when replacing the frame so CDNs/browsers don’t serve a stale overlay.

Frame source: [device-frames-media](https://github.com/jonnyjackson26/device-frames-media) (Apple iPhone 16 Pro / Black Titanium).

## Capture → site workflow

Personal devices often have no demo data. **Prefer iOS Simulator + `STORE_SCREENSHOTS` demo seed.**

1. **Capture** on Simulator with `STORE_SCREENSHOTS=true`, **without** island paste:

```bash
cd ../barem
SKIP_ISLAND_FINALIZE=1 ./tool/capture_ios_site_preview.sh
```

2. Land raw under `barem/store_assets/screenshots/raw/ios/` (or set `SRC=`).
3. **Resize only** into `barem-site/public/screenshots/`:

```bash
./tool/export_site_screenshots.sh
# → barem-site/public/screenshots/  (414×900, same filenames)
```

4. **Preview** composites in the frame (hero / top close-up) and get approval **before** going live.
5. Deploy:

```bash
cd ../barem-site
npm run deploy
git add public/screenshots docs && git commit && git push
```

## Rejected (do not use on the site)

- Store marketing composites (`barem/store_assets/screenshots/ios/` with headlines)
- Baking a bezel into the site PNG **and** also using `PhoneShot` (double frame)
- Pasting or erasing a Dynamic Island in site PNGs (causes double island or status-bar misalignment)
- CSS/SVG “fake iPhone” chassis (pill borders, hand-drawn SVG) instead of the real frame PNG
- Dropping raw 1320×2868 without resizing
- Pillow/device-bezel-baked site PNGs (old rejected pipeline)
